// LOCALHOST
### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Get single user
GET http://localhost:3000/users/6aa0cbdda4e7ece459e91579

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:3000/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Tony",
    "lastName": "Stark",
    "email": "tony@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "gold",
    "birthday": "29-5-1970"
}

### Update contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/6aa0cbdda4e7ece459e91579 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Bruce",
    "lastName": "Banner",
    "email": "banner@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "green",
    "birthday": "7-2-1978"
}

### Delete contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/6aa8ad011387a25794ce31ba